        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-07T18:28:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "where did these numbers come from? They seem rather odd... as though perhaps we\u0027re coding some specific vendor\u0027s implementation in to our AOSP source.",
